'''Thunder Heel Drop''' (イナズマヒールドロップ, ''Inazuma Hīrudoroppu'', '''Lightning Heel Drop''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

